# {{artificial intelligence}} A [[real]] or [[virtual]] [[computer]] [[system]] designed to [[emulate]] the [[brain]] in its [[ability]] to "[[learn]]" to [[assess]] [[imprecise]] [[data]].
# {{anatomy}} Any network of [[neuron]]s etc that [[function]] [[together]] to achieve a common purpose.

====Synonyms====
* [[neural net]]
* artificial neural network (ANN)
* simulated neural network (SNN)

